        "post_id": "51f24e35-a5d8-4481-8b6c-b385c10e0e94",
        "post_author": "user_4",
        "created_at": "2025-03-23T14:22:12.770733+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-03-23T14:22:12.770733+00:00",
        "post_text": "Just watched the SpaceX launch last night. The way those boosters landed in perfect sync was absolutely jaw-dropping. \ud83d\ude80 #SpaceX #Rockets",
        "likes": 140,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "8383176a-9f54-4d9a-a89e-cefcb5d4a24e",
        "post_author": "user_32",
        "created_at": "2025-06-03T02:02:54.225475+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-06-03T02:02:54.225475+00:00",
        "post_text": "NASA just dropped new James Webb images and I genuinely cannot comprehend how vast the universe is. Every photo rewires my brain. \ud83c\udf0c #JWST #Astronomy",
        "likes": 90,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "1580a106-c7d7-4c2a-8438-21d890bc7f4a",
        "post_author": "user_95",
        "created_at": "2024-06-05T05:56:25.443241+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-06-05T05:56:25.443241+00:00",
        "post_text": "Imagine waking up every morning and seeing Earth from the ISS window. The astronauts on the current expedition are living a reality I can only dream about. \ud83c\udf0d",
        "likes": 267,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "93921b73-b570-42e1-98ce-41ea404a6baa",
        "post_author": "user_95",
        "created_at": "2024-03-12T17:55:08.254853+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-03-12T17:55:08.254853+00:00",
        "post_text": "The Artemis program is our generation's moon shot. Can't wait to see the first woman and first person of color walk on the lunar surface. \ud83c\udf19 #Artemis #NASA",
        "likes": 191,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "5a848d94-70be-4fed-b0f0-fe23a08f97d0",
        "post_author": "user_12",
        "created_at": "2025-09-16T12:37:00.254789+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-16T12:37:00.254789+00:00",
        "post_text": "Reading the Perseverance rover findings this morning. The idea that we might find evidence of ancient microbial life on Mars is genuinely surreal.",
        "likes": 280,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "5779ea41-1909-41cc-8fe6-8933669c8a18",
        "post_author": "user_5",
        "created_at": "2025-02-17T08:16:27.152918+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-02-17T08:16:27.152918+00:00",
        "post_text": "SpaceX Starship test was spectacular \u2014 even the explosions were impressive. The scale of that rocket is incomprehensible until you see footage next to a person. \ud83d\ude80",
        "likes": 280,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "303b4ef9-38e8-4f11-88b1-7cc0244955df",
        "post_author": "user_28",
        "created_at": "2024-01-21T20:35:35.831614+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-01-21T20:35:35.831614+00:00",
        "post_text": "My daughter asked me if people really live in space. Explaining the ISS to a six-year-old and watching her eyes go wide was the best moment of my week. \ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\ude80",
        "likes": 341,
        "image_url": null
    },
