        "post_id": "b3e9222d-ff30-44e9-a8ba-3ae0377fc034",
        "post_author": "user_1",
        "created_at": "2025-07-20T14:25:54.019875+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-07-20T14:25:54.019875+00:00",
        "post_text": "The trick to making small rooms feel bigger is mirrors, lighter colors, and removing furniture you don't actually use. Learned this the expensive way. \ud83e\ude9e",
        "likes": 155,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "87a0122e-0066-4ce6-9f51-f25c950ced98",
        "post_author": "user_21",
        "created_at": "2025-06-15T03:57:49.564008+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-06-15T03:57:49.564008+00:00",
        "post_text": "Biophilic design is having a real moment and honestly it should have been the standard all along. Plants, natural light, organic materials \u2014 your nervous system will thank you. \ud83c\udf3f",
        "likes": 75,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "5bab02a5-023a-4ce2-924a-506c53b51d20",
        "post_author": "user_44",
        "created_at": "2025-05-03T16:44:30.608888+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-03T16:44:30.608888+00:00",
        "post_text": "Just hired an interior designer for the first time after years of DIY-ing everything. Already wondering why I waited so long. Completely worth it. \ud83c\udfe0",
        "likes": 131,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "b8a3f9c7-cacd-4c8a-840a-e95129c29e5f",
        "post_author": "user_28",
        "created_at": "2024-07-13T12:14:18.744301+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-07-13T12:14:18.744301+00:00",
        "post_text": "Tried the Japandi aesthetic in our bedroom \u2014 Japanese minimalism meets Scandinavian warmth. It is exactly as calm and restful as it sounds. \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f #Japandi #InteriorDesign",
        "likes": 240,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "4c00dee6-dab0-4fed-9ab9-ce5b112b22f7",
        "post_author": "user_44",
        "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:10:46.607066+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-11-01T01:10:46.607066+00:00",
        "post_text": "The color terracotta is everywhere right now and I am completely here for it. Warm, earthy, and somehow it goes with almost everything. \ud83e\uddf1 #HomeDecor",
        "likes": 175,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "247f3da1-6fbf-444e-91b8-703eb4a094a6",
        "post_author": "user_49",
        "created_at": "2024-03-12T13:07:57.523920+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-03-12T13:07:57.523920+00:00",
        "post_text": "Renovating our bathroom on a tight budget. New tile, vanity, and fixtures made a night-and-day difference. Before and after photos coming this weekend. \ud83d\udebf #DIY #HomeReno",
        "likes": 153,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "546ea184-cafa-46eb-bb08-e615dd64ea8e",
        "post_author": "user_45",
        "created_at": "2024-03-08T16:50:06.470888+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-03-08T16:50:06.470888+00:00",
        "post_text": "Layering textures is the fastest way to make a room feel designed rather than just furnished. Linen, wood, ceramic, and a good rug go a really long way. #InteriorDesign",
        "likes": 209,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "b81d7c88-ac7c-4201-91b1-6126532c2adc",
        "post_author": "user_6",
        "created_at": "2025-02-26T14:35:50.377070+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-02-26T14:35:50.377070+00:00",
        "post_text": "Our architect showed us how rearranging the same furniture in a different layout would completely change traffic flow and natural light in the room. Mind blown. \ud83c\udfe1",
        "likes": 279,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "6207cf5c-ccb0-4323-8680-26cab0551af2",
        "post_author": "user_69",
        "created_at": "2025-05-25T19:29:38.459242+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-25T19:29:38.459242+00:00",
        "post_text": "",
        "likes": 240,
        "image_url": "assets/interior.jpg"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f92887d3-5b36-49ed-b9cb-1bb4fcbad022",
        "post_author": "user_42",
        "created_at": "2025-07-13T09:08:17.524180+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-07-13T09:08:17.524180+00:00",
        "post_text": "The best interior design trick I know: treat every room as a series of zones. When you define the space clearly, even a small apartment feels intentional and roomy. \ud83c\udfe0 #InteriorDesign",
        "likes": 207,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "77837cd9-e740-4f3b-a93e-de066249a9b1",
        "post_author": "user_25",
        "created_at": "2024-05-18T02:52:50.302613+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-05-18T02:52:50.302613+00:00",
        "post_text": "We knocked down a wall and suddenly the whole space opened up. Natural light flooded in and the entire feel of the house changed. Best renovation decision we ever made. #HomeReno",
        "likes": 250,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f0736962-0151-45bb-a25c-097e2286b109",
        "post_author": "user_15",
        "created_at": "2025-07-29T18:56:18.979388+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-07-29T18:56:18.979388+00:00",
        "post_text": "Negative space is just as important as what you put in a room. Leaving breathing room between furniture pieces makes the whole space feel curated rather than cluttered. \ud83d\udecb\ufe0f #InteriorDesign",
        "likes": 147,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "48c79213-d4fc-498b-933b-6161ba67ee4d",
        "post_author": "user_72",
        "created_at": "2024-07-23T15:03:36.062471+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-07-23T15:03:36.062471+00:00",
        "post_text": "Small space, big personality. Our 400 sq ft studio fits a full living area, workspace, and bedroom because we planned every inch intentionally. #TinyLiving #InteriorDesign",
        "likes": 220,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "4467f8ac-15c6-4375-a4f0-23295d1df70f",
        "post_author": "user_31",
        "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:56:13.506503+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-11-30T18:56:13.506503+00:00",
        "post_text": "The mistake most people make in interior design is buying furniture before measuring the space. Always measure twice, buy once. The proportions make or break the room. \ud83d\udcd0",
        "likes": 175,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "6f89ce96-7234-4ab1-a128-7fe32dbd57e0",
        "post_author": "user_81",
        "created_at": "2024-04-11T19:55:14.218863+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2024-04-11T19:55:14.218863+00:00",
        "post_text": "Vertical space is the most underused dimension in interior design. Floor-to-ceiling shelving draws the eye up and makes any room feel dramatically taller. #HomeDecor #InteriorDesign",
        "likes": 110,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "3034a3db-185e-42dc-8e26-6a1dd30ce4f3",
        "post_author": "user_1",
        "created_at": "2025-04-07T18:49:32.371524+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-04-07T18:49:32.371524+00:00",
        "post_text": "Our designer reconfigured the space without moving a single wall \u2014 just changed the furniture layout and lighting plan. The space now flows in a way it never did before. \u2728 #InteriorDesign",
        "likes": 99,
        "image_url": null
    },
    {
        "post_id": "0eb6139e-5184-4329-af52-676861353ed7",
        "post_author": "user_4",
        "created_at": "2025-08-18T18:47:47.135498+00:00",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-18T18:47:47.135498+00:00",
        "post_text": "Multifunctional furniture is a game changer for small spaces. A storage ottoman, a fold-down desk, a sofa bed \u2014 every piece in the space has to earn its place. #SmallSpaceLiving",
        "likes": 114,
        "image_url": null
    }
]